Package: PlotTrellis
Title: Composable Genomic Track Visualisations for Non-Coders
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Aleksander", "Pacnik", email = "pacnik.a@wehi.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A plotgardener-based genomic track composer that lets biologists
    build common EDA visualisations (coverage, Hi-C, splice junctions,
    transcript structure, protein domains) via a Shiny interface, without
    writing code, and download a standalone R script that reproduces the
    exact figure offline.
